### Script to trace/time methods using jcan log tracing
# Syntax:
#    tracing_profiles.pl [-l<n>] [-m <method>]  < input.log
#
# Where input.log is a log file with enabled tracing (set priority to TRACE in
# log4j config). E.g.:
#   <category name="com.crh.logon.business.services.impl"><priority value="INFO"/></category>
#
# Options:
#    -l<n>         Specify depth
#    -m <method>   Specify name of method where to start tracing.
#
# Examples below:

# Top level: don't indicate method name
$ tracing_profiler.pl -l1 < log_qtime_tracing_initDeliverySettingShiptoMap.txt
24903ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.DeliverySettingShiptoMap
23292ms /   16 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initDeliverySettingSalesAreaMap
 1445ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initGlobalTransportBackgroundData
   72ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.loadWagonTypeWrappers
   61ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.loadTruckTypeWrappers
    1ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.loadShipTypeWrappers
    1ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.loadBlockTrainTypeWrappers

# Investigate specific method: use -m option
$ tracing_profiler.pl -l1 -m initDeliverySettingSalesAreaMap < log_qtime_tracing_initDeliverySettingShiptoMap.txt
1558ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initDeliverySettingSalesAreaMap
 504ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initFinancialBackgroundData
 437ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initMaterialAvailabilityBackgroundData
 351ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initMaterialSelectionForShipto
 261ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initDeliverySettingProductLists

$ tracing_profiler.pl -l1 -m initFinancialBackgroundData < log_qtime_tracing_initDeliverySettingShiptoMap.txt
504ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.initFinancialBackgroundData
119ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.loadPayers
112ms /    2 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.fetchSapBpSareasForSapBp
 86ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.fetchSapSoldBillSareas
 32ms /    1 calls: DeliverySettingServiceBean.fetchSapBpCompCodes
